              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nyakati 33:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona mfalume Josiya achiamuru mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu Hilikiya na alavyadzi-sadaka asaidizie na arindzi a mryango alavye kula Nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu vitu virivyotengezwa kpwa ajili ya Baali, Ashera na kpwa ajili ya vitu vyosi vya mlunguni. Waviocha kondze ya Jerusalemu kpwenye dete ra Kidironi na kuphirika ivure Betheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona waausa alavyadzi-sadaka osi a kuabudu chizuka choikpwa ni afalume a Juda kufukiza uvumba mwatu mwa dzulu mwa kuabudira kpwenye midzi ya Juda na kuzunguluka Jerusalemu, na piya hara ariofukiza uvumba kpwa Baali, dzuwa, mwezi, nyenyezi na vitu vyosi vya mlunguni ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye wausa chizuka cha Ashera kula ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, kondze ya Jerusalemu, achichiphirika hadi kpwenye chidzuho cha Kidironi. Hiko wachiocha na kuchisaga hadi chichikala vumbi, naro vumbire waritawanya dzulu ya mbira za atu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabomola nyumba za malaya zokala ndani ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, phatu achetu ariphofuma mapaziya ga Ashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wareha alavyadzi-sadaka osi kula midzi ya Juda na achinajisi mwatu mwa dzulu mwa kuabudu, alavyadzi-sadaka arimofukiza uvumba, kula Geba hadi Beeri-Sheba. Wabomola phatu pha dzulu pha kuabudu phokala uphande wa kumotso wa ryango rya mudzi phokala maryango gokala phatu pha kumenyera phoihwa ryango ra Joshuwa, liwali wa Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hinyo alavyadzi-sadaka a mwatu mwa dzulu taayapanda phatu pha kulavira sadaka kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu hiko Jerusalemu, ela aruhusiwa kurya mikahe isiyotiywa hamira kahi ya ndugu zao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
