              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 12:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaidi ya higo, hiko Betheli wabomola phatu pha kulavira sadaka na achiocha mwatu mwa dzulu mwa kuabudu modzengbwa ni mfalume Jeroboamu mwana wa Nebati ambaye waahenda atu a Iziraeli ainjire dambini. Wabananga phatu pha kulavira sadaka hizo na kuvundza mawege vipande-vipande, na chisha achivibunda-bunda hadi vichikala vumbi. Piya chizuka cha Ashera wachiocha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Josiya ariphogaluka waona mbira dzulu ya chidzango. Walagiza mifupha ichifukulwa kula mbirani na ichiochwa dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka, chihivyo achiphatiya najisi. Gago gahendeka sawa-sawa na neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu ambaro ratangazwa ni nabii yetabiri mambo higa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.30+1KI.13.31+1KI.13.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 13:30–32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu mfalume wauza, “Dziwe rira ni mbira ya ani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao atu a mudzi amjibu achiamba, “Ni mbira ya mutu wa Mlungu ambaye wakpwedza kula Juda na kutabiri mambo ambago ukagahenda kuhusu phatu pha kulavira sadaka pha Betheli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
